= Mark Natanson

Natanson (1850-1919), a veteran populist and a founder of the party, has the authority of forty years of prison and exile. He is the Left SRs' elder.

- @action
- @root: Return to main

@action
title: Elder's Authority
subtitle: Natanson's authority calms the party's quarrels.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
for (var f of Q.factions) { RO.fac(Q, f, 0, -6); } RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 1, 0);
!}

The old man sat at the head of the table, and the quarrels stopped. There is no authority like that of a man who has spent his life in prison.

- @cancel_advisor_action: Cancel action.
